  splatTime: 2.5
  introTime: 7
  dayIntros:
  - 'Three years ago you went out for milk.

    You never came back.


    Now you''re
    divorced, deep in debt to BIG DAIRY,

    and all you''ve got left is this ice
    cream truck.


    Feed the kids. Pay the man. Win them back.'
  - 'Meanwhile, at your ex''s house...

    Your kid asked who the guy in the truck
    is.

    Your ex said "nobody, sweetie."'
  - 'Meanwhile, at your ex''s house...

    The kids made a video about you.

    It
    has four views. All yours.'
  - 'Big Dairy sent a fruit basket.

    It''s all milk.'
  - 'Final installment.

    Your ex says she''s "cautiously curious."

    Don''t
    blow this.'
  - 'Overtime.

    Big Dairy charges interest in milk.'
